@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

# Replace baseUrl with the API endpoint reported by `aspire describe`.

### List the first page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog?pageIndex=0&pageSize=10

### Read an item and copy its ETag to If-Match
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/1

### Create an item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample catalog item",
  "description": "Created through the Catalog API",
  "price": 12.50,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "availableStock": 10,
  "restockThreshold": 2,
  "maxStockThreshold": 20
}

### Update an item using the ETag returned by GET
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "00000000"

{
  "name": "Updated catalog item",
  "description": "Updated through the Catalog API",
  "price": 12.50,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "availableStock": 10,
  "restockThreshold": 2,
  "maxStockThreshold": 20
}

### Delete an item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/1

### Read an unknown item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/999999
